              },
              {
                "type": "regex",
                "value": "(?:unverified|not verified|(?:does not|do not|cannot|never).{0,80}(?:establish|verify|prove|execute)|without (?:starting|running|executing) (?:the )?(?:application|tests))"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2,
            "prompt": "Using agent-qa version 0.2.3, the command `agent-qa run tests/checkout.yaml --dry-run` exited 1 with \"Env file not found: .env\". The dashboard has no new run verdict. Did checkout fail? State the outcome and next action without changing configuration.",
            "expected_output": "The missing .env caused a setup, environment, or preflight failure: the dry run was blocked by a missing required file. Checkout was not executed; its application outcome is unresolved, not a completed checkout failure. Investigate the required file without rewriting configuration. If suggesting a command, use agent-qa run without inserting the version number as a subcommand.",
            "assertions": [
              {
                "type": "regex",
                "value": "(?:setup|preflight|environment|precondition|blocked.{0,80}(?:missing|required))"
              },
              {
                "type": "contains",
